ed\">Quests</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><center><b>None</b></center></div></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/knight-outfits-quest\">Knight Outfits Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/shaman-outfits-quest\">Shaman Outfits Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/warrior-outfits-quest\">Warrior Outfits Quest</a></li></ul></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">7.8<br/>August 1, 2006<br/>Summer Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><b>Sabrehaven</b> is a small rebel settlement on the island of <a href=\"#/wiki/Meriana\">Meriana</a> in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Shattered%20Isles\">Shattered Isles</a>. From this outpost, a small group of rebels avoids and protests the Thaian occupation of <a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a>.\n</p><p>The settlement is complete with shops for food and equipment, and is mostly self-sustaining.\n</p><p>You can travel to Sabrehaven from <a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a> via <a href=\"#/wiki/Captain%20Waverider\">Captain Waverider</a>. Secret password: 'peg leg'. <a href=\"#/quest/the-shattered-isles-quest\">The Shattered Isles Quest</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\